  tenTranh: "G\xE0 "
  moTa: "Trong cu\u1ED9c s\u1ED1ng \u1EDF n\xF4ng th\xF4n th\u1EDDi x\u01B0a, g\xE0
    v\xE0 l\u1EE3n l\xE0 hai v\u1EADt nu\xF4i v\xF4 c\xF9ng g\u1EA7n g\u0169i, quen
    thu\u1ED9c. B\u1EB1ng nh\u1EEFng m\xE0u s\u1EAFc, \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng n\xE9t
    d\xE2n d\xE3 mang t\xEDnh \u01B0\u1EDBc l\u1EC7 cao, nh\u1EEFng con g\xE0, con
    l\u1EE3n tr\xEAn tranh \u0110\xF4ng H\u1ED3 \u0111\xE3 c\xF5ng tr\xEAn l\u01B0ng
    m\xECnh c\u1EA3 m\u1ED9t b\u1EA7u t\xE2m t\u01B0, kh\xE1t v\u1ECDng c\u1EE7a
    nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi n\xF4ng d\xE2n.\r\n\r\n"
